<p>QR Menu started from a simple idea: a restaurant's menu changes all the time — prices, seasonal dishes, allergens — and keeping it up to date on paper or in complicated tools is extra work nobody has time to do well.</p>

<h2>What we do</h2>
<p>We build a digital menu that any restaurant can manage on its own, without technical knowledge: it's edited in minutes from a panel designed for a restaurant's day-to-day, and customers see it instantly by scanning a QR code, without installing anything.</p>

<h2>How we think about the product</h2>
<ul>
    <li>The restaurant keeps full control of its menu and its data.</li>
    <li>No complicated setup: the essentials should take minutes.</li>
    <li>The menu has to look good and work just as well for the customer as for the owner who updates it every day.</li>
</ul>

<p>If you have questions about the product, you can write to us — the contact details are in our <a href="{{ path('app_privacy') }}">privacy policy</a>.</p>
